// GetNetworkSecurityLANManagerAuthenticationLevel reads ./Device/Vendor/MSFT/Policy/Config/LocalPoliciesSecurityOptions/NetworkSecurity_LANManagerAuthenticationLevel.
// Network security LAN Manager authentication level This security setting determines which
