// Windows 2000 and windows XP: send LM and NTLM responses Windows Server 2003: Send NTLM response
// only Windows Vista, Windows Server 2008, Windows 7, and Windows Server 2008 R2: Send NTLMv2
// response only
//
// Default: 3.
