// GetUserAccountControlBehaviorOfTheElevationPromptForAdministrators reads ./Device/Vendor/MSFT/Policy/Config/LocalPoliciesSecurityOptions/UserAccountControl_BehaviorOfTheElevationPromptForAdministrators.
// User Account Control: Behavior of the elevation prompt for administrators in Admin Approval Mode
// This policy setting controls the behavior of the elevation prompt for administrators. The
// options are: • Elevate without prompting: Allows privileged accounts to perform an operation
